{"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:isError:isReadOnly:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:tableName:bundle:isError:isReadOnly:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoradio"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Radio button is a UI element that allows to select a single option from a set of mutually exclusive choices."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Radio button that does not show icon or text, provides greater flexibility when creating other components that require a Radio button to be displayed."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISORadio","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Particular-cases","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Particular cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look-and-feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note also the component must be instanciated with a string parameter used as accessibility label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is a good pratice (at least) to define a label for a component without text for accessibility reasons. This label will be vocalized by "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The vocalization tool will also use, after the label, a description of the component (if disabled, if error context), and a fake trait for radio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No accessibility identifier is defined in MISO side as this value remains in the users hands."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Cases forbidden by design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error or read only situation and a disabled component."}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var selection: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A simple radio, no error, not in read only mode","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\")","","    \/\/ A simple radio, but is an error context","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true)","","    \/\/ Never disable an error-related radio button as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.12.0"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents9MISORadioV","title":"MISORadio","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISORadio":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocompo